<title>USA: Mauston, Wisc., $1.26 mln won by John G. Kinnard.</title>
<headline>Mauston, Wisc., $1.26 mln won by John G. Kinnard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>John G. Kinnard &amp; Co., Inc. said it won $1.260 million of Mauston, Wisc., general obligation promissory notes, with a true interest cost of 4.7159 percent.</p>
</text>
